<title>USA: Metro Tel hires investment banker.</title>
<headline>Metro Tel hires investment banker.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metro Tel Corp said Monday it had engaged the investment banking firm Slusser Associates Inc to assist it in evaluating strategic alternatives, such as acquisitions, mergers or the sale of the company.</p>
<p>Metro Tel is a manufacturer of telephone test equipment and peripheral telephone products.</p>
